[0minteractive mode.                                                                                                                      \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mRich Multiline Editor\u001b[0m – Press \u001b[1;36;40mCtrl+E\u001b[0m (or use \u001b[1;36;40mngpt -t\u001b[0m without a prompt) to open a full editor with syntax highlighting for complex      \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m   \u001b[0minputs.                                                                                                                                \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mDiff‑Based Commit Messages\u001b[0m – Use \u001b[1;36;40m--diff file.patch\u001b[0m or let ngpt pick the staged changes automatically for git commit message            \u001b"]
