[0.004, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[36m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[1;36m 🤖 nGPT \u001b[0m\u001b[36m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[36m─╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mRich Multiline Editor\u001b[0m – Press \u001b[1;36;40mCtrl+E\u001b[0m (or use \u001b[1;36;40mngpt -t\u001b[0m without a prompt) to open a full editor with syntax highlighting for complex      \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m   \u001b[0minputs.                                                                                                                                \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1mDiff‑Based Commit Messages\u001b[0m – Use \u001b[1;36;40m--diff file.patch\u001b[0m or let ngpt pick the staged changes automatically for git commit message            \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m   \u001b[0mgeneration.                                                                                                                            \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2m-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;35m7. Performance & Architecture\u001b[0m                                                                                                             \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m ngpt is written in Python but is designed to be minimal‑dependency and highly responsive. It streams responses in real time, rendering    \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m markdown and code syntax on the fly, which is especially handy for developers who want to see results instantly.                          \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2m-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;35m8. Where to Learn More\u001b[0m                                                                                                                    \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0mOfficial documentation: https://nazdridoy.github.io/ngpt/                                                                              \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0mGitHub repository: https://github.com/nazdridoy/ngpt                                        "]
