                                         \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2m-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;35m7. Performance & Architecture\u001b[0m                                                                                                             \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m ngpt is written in Python but is designed to be minimal‑dependency and highly responsive. It streams responses in real time, rendering    \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m markdown and code syntax on the fly, which is especially handy for developers who want to see results instantly.                          \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2m-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;35m8. Where to Learn More\u001b[0m                                                                                                                    \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                           \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0mOfficial documentation: https://nazdridoy.github.io/ngpt/                                                                              \u001b[36m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1m • \u001b[0mGitHub repository: https://github.com/nazdridoy/ngpt                                        "]
